<title>HONG KONG: Guangdong Tannery shrs debut at HK$2.50.</title>
<headline>Guangdong Tannery shrs debut at HK$2.50.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Guangdong Tannery Ltd, a leather unit of Guangdong Investment Ltd, made their trading debut at HK$2.50 per share on Monday, more than double their issue price of HK$1.03 each.</p>
</text>
